dge Theatre\",\"metaDescription\":\"Get in touch with the team. Find contact details, opening hours and how to reach us. We’re here to help with your enquiry.\"},\"helpSection\":{\"heading\":\"How can we help?\",\"description\":\"Choose the type of enquiry below to find the right information or get in touch with our team\",\"cards\":[{\"title\":\"Help \u0026 FAQs\",\"description\":\"Your go-to place for quick answers about bookings and your visit\",\"icon\":\"help\",\"cta\":{\"description\":\"Visit Help \u0026 FAQs\",\"action\":\"https://help.trafalgartickets.com/knowledge/\"}},{\"title\":\"Groups \u0026 schools\",\"description\":\"Planning a visit for 8+ people? Our Groups team can help with bookings\",\"icon\":\"groups\",\"cta\":{\"description\":\"Group enquiry\",\"action\":\"https://share-eu1.hsforms.com/1jkbedVH0Q72o9T-kT3wg5Afktux?venue_name=Bridge%20Theatre\"}},{\"title\":\"Venue hire\",\"description\":\"Looking to hire one of our spaces? Contact out team to start your enquiry\",\"icon\":\"source_environment\",\"cta\":{\"description\":\"Venue hire enquiry\",\"action\":\"https://share-eu1.hsforms.com/1Nfj5EEm0RjCV9XRpz45OcAfktux\"}}]},\"header\":{\"title\":\"Contact us\",\"description\":\"If you need help with a booking or have a question about your visit, we're here to help. You can browse our Help Centre or choose an enquiry type below.\"},\"hubspotForm\":{\"header\":\"Get in touch\",\"description\":\"If you've got a question, a comment or just want to share your thoughts about our venues or a recent experience, please use the form to drop us a message or email us and we'll get back to you. \u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e For all other queries, we'll respond as soon as possible, usually within 48 hours.\"}},\"venueHire\":{\"title\":\"Venue Hire\",\"description\":\"Host your event in one of our unique theatre spaces\",\"hubspotForm\":{\"header\":\"Planning an event?\",\"description\":\"Whether you’re planning a corporate event, looking for private hire, show