-Photographer-Manuel-Harlan-0653.jpg\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1875},{\"alt\":\"The Cast of Pride at the National Theatre. Photo credit Manuel Harlan\",\"src\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/4ky7SbJxzgb6B7UAMjkZ6Q/b094e898807a06e51aceec534bdeed02/3-The-Cast-of-Pride-at-the-National-Theatre.-Photographer-Manuel-Harlan-0808.jpg\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1666},{\"alt\":\"The Cast of Pride at the National Theatre. Photo credit Manuel Harlan\",\"src\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/2mz9OkkV1l7XKVhT6GRkNU/39427e0c7f1594e92acefa95b29a9f27/4-The-Cast-of-Pride-at-the-National-Theatre.-Photographer-Manuel-Harlan-0545-1.jpg\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1666},{\"alt\":\"The Cast of Pride at the National Theatre. Photo credit Manuel Harlan\",\"src\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/eocMNB1cLEbiviSxg3Y3s/b910ed028d819fc5402c8aa04a663a91/5-The-Cast-of-Pride-at-the-National-Theatre.-Photographer-Manuel-Harlan-0306.webp\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1666},{\"alt\":\"The Cast of Pride at the National Theatre. Photo credit Manuel Harlan\",\"src\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/4Zh41sbPFhFAg4ABgLndNT/482f5e1d9c1bfc27f258eea6c946f839/8-The-Cast-of-Pride-at-the-National-Theatre.-Photographer-Manuel-Harlan-0580.webp\",\"width\":2314,\"height\":1762},{\"alt\":\"The Cast of Pride at the National Theatre. Photo credit Manuel Harlan\",\"src\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/6OVzrJjBkR9Qj8VjvTnYAa/32d7c976ae383c2345363d30a7d3d26e/9-The-Cast-of-Pride-at-the-National-Theatre.-Photographer-Manuel-Harlan-0039.webp\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1666},{\"alt\":\"Caroline Sheen (Maureen), Darren Lawrence (Cliff), Gillian Elisa (Gwen) Matthew Woodyatt (Dai), Sarah Pugh (Siân) and Kirsty Malpass (Hefina) in Pride. Photo credit Manuel Harlan\",\"src\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/4OAc90AU5p8hAzTkx8QQo4/3289551cc6f267e09a6abcb048ed4e76/6-Caroline-Sheen-Maureen-Darren-Lawrence-Cliff-Gillian-Elisa-Gwen-Matthew-Woodyatt-Dai-Sarah-Pugh-Sian-and-Kirsty-Malpass-H.webp\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1666},{\"alt\":\"Jhon Lumsden (Mark), Matthew Durkan (Mike) and Chris Jenkins (Gethin) in Pride at the National Theatre. Photo credit Manuel Harlan\",\"src\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/2UuNrKMNiL6prRzLgnsZFP/bb636545de0d66d5168c124c91bf91cd/7-Jhon-Lumsden-Mark-Matthew-Durkan-Mike-and-Chris-Jenkins-Gethin-in-Pride-at-the-National-Theatre.-Photographer-Manuel-Harl.webp\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1666},{\"alt\":\"The Cast of Pride at the National Theatre. Photo credit Manuel Harlan\",\"src\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/4OrIwE7NFWFSdcEo7b93hi/7938ac48fee27ec765c94b0a70136ac9/11-The-Cast-of-Pride-at-the-National-Theatre.-Photographer-Manuel-Harlan-0691.webp\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1614},{\"alt\":\"Matthew Woodyatt (Dai), Jhon Lumsden (Mark) Darren Lawrence (Cliff), Matthew Durkan (Mike), Courtney Stapleton (Steph) and Jordan Shaw (Reggie) in Pride. Photo credit Manuel Harlan\",\"src\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/51FTZTGNmOH99fIsm8HIQt/b3e9e595843df3bb19ea09a1a7ffdf1a/10-Matthew-Woodyatt-Dai-Jhon-Lumsden-Mark-Darren-Lawrence-Cliff-Matthew-Durkan-Mike-Courtney-Stapleton-Steph-and-Jordan-Sha.webp\",\"width\":2500,\"height\":1666}],\"richTextDescription\":{\"json\":{\"nodeType\":\"document\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Following record-breaking sold-out runs at Cardiff's Sherman Theatre and London’s National Theatre, join us for \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Pride the Musical\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\" at the Bridge Theatre from 12 November.  \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Summer 1984. The government is threatening the coal industry. Elsewhere, it brands homosexuality a threat to British family values. Seizing an unlikely opportunity, 24-year-old activist Mark Ashton rallies a group of lesbian and gay campaigners to raise money for striking miners in South Wales. \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Fuelled by hope, solidarity and their love of a laugh, the two communities transform division into unity through an extraordinary bond of friendship.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Having inspired millions with their hilarious and heartfelt film Pride\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\", \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"writer Stephen Beresford (Elsinore) and director Matthew Warchus (Matilda the Musical) reunite to bring its incredible true story to the stage, with original songs inspired by 80s pop, rock, disco and the Welsh choral tradition. \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Book Pride musical tickets at Bridge Theatre today - don't miss out on this new musical based on an incredible true story. \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]}]},\"links\":{\"assets\":{\"block\":[]},\"entries\":{\"inline\":[],\"block\":[]}}},\"tagline\":\"Pride - A new musical based on an incredible true story\",\"runtime\":\"2 hrs 40 mins (incl. interval)\",\"ageRestriction\":\"12+\",\"ageRestrictionType\":\"Recommended\",\"specialEffectsContentSensoryWarnings\":[\"Strobe or flashing lights\",\"Smoke, haze, or fog\"],\"productionRoles\":[{\"roleName\":\"Jonathan\",\"productionMember\":{\"name\":\"Samuel Barnett\",\"headshotUrl\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/68GOAKaQZVrOVNvaC3ny7z/eb7e286fcb8d4d37aa52026ac5045ef7/Samuel_Barnett.jpg\"}},{\"roleName\":\"Swing\",\"productionMember\":{\"name\":\"Joe Boyle\",\"headshotUrl\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/62oB7rILNyEyYeSyOKVu93/e79b83bdc2e3f1cef026292da6049a6e/joe_headshot.png\"}},{\"roleName\":\"Swing\",\"productionMember\":{\"name\":\"Billy Cullum\",\"headshotUrl\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/7h4kij7EPu41AmLmb3UQPo/4d6f7fb2d4cfc3d82946d0374ab23419/billy.png\"}},{\"roleName\":\"Mike\",\"productionMember\":{\"name\":\"Matthew Durkan\",\"headshotUrl\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/3ZzSX6gDsrFIb2jkpesuP9/98e90a2e8b59f2f444dc779df1dc8814/Matthew_Durkan.jpg\"}},{\"roleName\":\"Gwen\",\"productionMember\":{\"name\":\"Gillian Elisa\",\"headshotUrl\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/67ruYXLJzukSLG8VRUGL58/146189aefa9893e3e87eca52aaea4380/Gillian_Elisa.jpg\"}},{\"roleName\":\"Carl\",\"productionMember\":{\"name\":\"Daniel Forrester\",\"headshotUrl\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/IqUZTMtA5DZGpB4l6AlRu/6d710a263677c82288e9ffa05e0f9ce3/Daniel_Forrester_-_Headshot.jpg\"}},{\"roleName\":\"Bromley\",\"productionMember\":{\"name\":\"Dan Hand\",\"headshotUrl\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/1qsfcb1WcQkTeQtbewxVWV/1b54ae98adeb3ef3bd1b517f23975185/Dan_Hand_-_Headshot.jpg\"}},{\"roleName\":\"Martin\",\"productionMember\":{\"name\":\"Robin Hayward\",\"headshotUrl\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/4PLLBp6YHa0fI1p4PluJbP/468d447914c31bea686d40db9dc5546b/robin_hayward.png\"}},{\"roleName\":\"Swing\",\"productionMember\":{\"name\":\"Ben Heathcote\",\"headshotUrl\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/3xpUq6Nfj2vKdHO3FbNOXk/2cab5cd00a8c0b3f0466e63dc8d5194e/ben_heathcote.png\"}},{\"roleName\":\"Gethin\",\"productionMember\":{\"name\":\"Chris Jenkins\",\"headshotUrl\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/3Zp2ofASe2OYBMOnuwYIqb/df87dddb1c1518939c29652cb8998f8c/Chris_Jenkins.webp\"}},{\"roleName\":\"Mark\",\"productionMember\":{\"name\":\"Ryan Kopel\",\"headshotUrl\":\"https://images.ctfassets.net/le9bkneeoxws/29wf7NWhXWD5n3PUpoue99/7568bc5a6634ead8c01b79cf1ebaf275/ryan_kopel.png\"}},{\"roleName\":\"S